div.div:

      مِحْضِيرٌ , applied to a horse, (S, A, K, &c.,) and
to a mare, (S, M,) That runs much, or vehemently; syn. كَثِيرُ العَدْوِ, (S,) or شَدِيدُ الحُضْرِ;
(M;) as also ↓ مِحْضَارٌ , applied without ة to a
mare; (M;) or this latter is not allowable;
(S, K;) or is of weak authority: (K:) pl. [of
both] مَحَاضِيرُ. (A.)
